{"id":"u-a5c10eb5-6cd4-469e-86b3-2d84296398ce","src":"community","title":"Hypertrophy - machines and bars program","author":"Arthur B.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/uvMnlW-untitled-program","desc":"This is an 8-week program, based on machines, pull up and dip bars.\n\nI chose machines to decrease risk and make the program safer for maybe older, younger or just an adult getting back into the flow from possibly an injury so the weight is stabilised and shouldn’t cause any injuries easily.\n\nThe program has three stages:\n\n-the adjusting; this helps if you’re new to lifting or hypertrophy or just coming back from a deload between programs, with 12 reps at 3 sets.\n\n-the main run; this is the main section of the program, where you do a base of 14 reps at 3 sets, to increase muscle use from the previous stage.\n\n-the final push; this is the last two weeks, where there’s an extra day added on to make 4 days a week. This is where an extra upper day, mainly shoulders and chest, have to work more often and should increase growth.\n\n(Some exercises can be switched to assisted, band or cable if needed. e.g. pull-ups or tricep dips)","level":["Intermediate","Beginner"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-31T10:15:57.748Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper day","Lower day","Full body + core","Extras day"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"One Arm Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Finger Pushups","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hamstring Curl","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Calf 